,"text":"Mónus Zoltán (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U13):"},{"_key":"7f811851227e1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"7f811851227e2","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Voltál már Londonban?"},{"_key":"7f811851227e3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"7f811851227e4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"7f811851227e5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"7f811851227e6","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Még sajnos nem, de tervezem, hogy egyszer eljussak oda is."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"63a018cdba8c","_type":"image","url":"/archiv/kepek/fc4601fb627b4c05374e1b9873a882b98d116f00-1000x666.webp"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f92","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f920","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Zádori Enikő (Vasas Kubala Akadémia – női felnőtt csapat):"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f921","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f922","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Elfogadjátok-e a meghívásunkat egy meccsünkre?"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f923","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f924","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f925","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"7e3a6a3a7f926","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Természetesen igen!"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"88609e13dc6f0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Ardai Attila (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U15):"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f2","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Mennyire figyelsz oda az étkezésedre?"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"88609e13dc6f6","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Néha nehezen megy, de természetesen próbálok odafigyelni arra, hogy mit eszem."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"2c923bf087ea0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Ardai Attila (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U15):"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea2","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Milyennek látod a csapat összhangját? Min lehetne szerinted javítani vagy mi az, ami nagyon jó?"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"2c923bf087ea6","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- A csapat összhangja nagyon sokat fejlődött tavaly, azóta szépen összecsiszolódtunk."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea90","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Ardai Attila (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U15):"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea91","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea92","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Mennyire szoktátok megérteni egymást a szélső védővel?"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea93","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea94","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea95","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"1d1a80f03ea96","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Megértjük egymást, de ez így van a védőkkel, középpályásokkal, támadókkal is."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"310e41e71110","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"310e41e711100","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Fátyol Balázs (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U14):"},{"_key":"310e41e711101","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"310e41e711102","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Van kedvenc cseled? Szerinted egy cselt hányszor kell gyakorolni, hogy azt magabiztosan tudd alkalmazni?"},{"_key":"310e41e711103","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"310e41e711104","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"310e41e711105","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"310e41e711106","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Nincs kimondottan kedvenc cselem. Fontos, hogy sokszor gyakorolj, próbálkozz éles szituációkban, merd megcsinálni, hidd el, sikerülni fog."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"9e826045876f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"9e826045876f0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Fátyol Balázs (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U14):"},{"_key":"9e826045876f1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"9e826045876f2","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- A tavalyi szezonban melyik gólodat tartottad a legszebb találatnak?"},{"_key":"9e826045876f3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"9e826045876f4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"9e826045876f5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"9e826045876f6","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- A DEAC elleni gólomat, az őszi 4:1-es mérkőzésen."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Fátyol Balázs (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U14):"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa2","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- A bajnoki mérkőzések előtt mi a vacsorád?"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"8777ae5cdefa6","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Változó. Természetesen azért nem pörköltet eszek meccsek előtt, de változatosan és főleg egészségesen próbálok étkezni."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"a8349c1f4706","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"a8349c1f47060","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Fátyol Balázs (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U14):"},{"_key":"a8349c1f47061","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"a8349c1f47062","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Gól vagy gólpassz? Számodra melyik a nagyobb öröm - vagy ugyanolyan fontos mindkettő?"},{"_key":"a8349c1f47063","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"a8349c1f47064","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"a8349c1f47065","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"a8349c1f47066","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Ez nehéz kérdés, de talán inkább a gólt választanám. Természetesen nagyon örülök a gólpassznak is, hiszen azzal hozzájárulhatok a sikerhez."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec057","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"e7d2284ec0570","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Fátyol Balázs (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U14):"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec0571","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec0572","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Volt már rá példa, hogy az edző nem azon a poszton játszatott, amiben te a legjobban érzed magad és úgy gondolod, hogy a legjobb teljesítményt tudod nyújtani? Ha igen, vajon mit kell ilyenkor tennie egy focistának?"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec0573","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec0574","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec0575","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"e7d2284ec0576","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Igen, volt már rá példa. Fontos, hogy ahol játszol, ott kell maximálisan teljesíteni."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"3f3c25af096f0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Ménesi Kevin (Vasas Kubala Akadémia - U12):"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f2","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- Mi motivál a meccsek alatt?"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Hinora Kristóf (Vasas Futball Club):"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"3f3c25af096f6","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"- A győzelem! Győzni kell, csak ez jár a fejemben."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}